  "notes": "Vanilla humanoid pivots (head 24, shoulders \u00b15/22, hips \u00b12/12): armor and held items line up. Elbows at y 18, knees at y 6. Arms swing opposite to the leg on the same side; forearms follow through. Shrink to 3/4 for a child, widen torso for a brute, add a third joint (hand) for a boss. Attack: Overhead right-arm swing: windup 0.3 (arm back, torso twists), impact 0.5 (arm down, torso follows), recovery 0.65, rest 1.0."
